    "title": "Speaking and interaction practice",
    "subtitle": "Two versions of the plan · 1 · preparation 1",
    "context": "Use this subset of the time vocabulary and constructions in a short self-contained situation, preparing for U3-04. Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to reconcile a schedule conflict and explain the resulting order of events.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U3-04-P01-speak-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Explain the situation",
        "questions": [
